# Heterogeneous routing — the portfolio narrative: cheap models where the task is
# structuring/templating, a local model where nothing sensitive leaves the machine,
# the strongest model on the safety gate. Needs GEMINI_API_KEY (+ ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
# if you keep the Opus line; otherwise change LLM_SAFETY to a Gemini model).
LLM_INTAKE=gemini/gemini-2.5-flash
LLM_BIOMECH=gemini/gemini-2.5-flash
LLM_RECOMMENDATION=gemini/gemini-2.5-flash
LLM_SAFETY=anthropic/claude-opus-5
LLM_DOCUMENTATION=ollama/qwen2.5:7b
OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434/v1
